---
description: Require explicit user confirmation before destructive delete actions
alwaysApply: true
---

# Confirm Delete Actions

- Any UI action that deletes data, files, records, assets, or user-entered content must ask for explicit confirmation before sending the delete request.
- Confirmation must happen immediately before the destructive call, not only through button wording or color.
- Backend/API delete endpoints should still enforce authorization and ownership; frontend confirmation is an additional safety step, not the only guard.
